daf9","position":{"commit_sha":"8fb928154c0c84b4a3e9111b349c1cdcdecf9172","position":"1785389613136245001-bb150d49-c7f2-4c1a-ab2b-d08ff3abdaf9"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"65d7f8a5a11ee8e3d40c57473334b0f2915c0fbfd982f350ff0f468cb2f6e309","event_uuid":"c65322bd-d049-4a5d-977a-c2e44dcb2693","position":{"commit_sha":"b6b2da75702602372082fdb541f62fe5d2efbcd6","position":"1785389616039140001-c65322bd-d049-4a5d-977a-c2e44dcb2693"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Scaffolding ticket, not real work. Created solely to produce evidence for story 84c7-ad6c-be99-4c30 (epic 9109-2ad9-2477-4cf6): its Scope deliberately claims a grep-derived file inventory for _anthropic_cache_settings so the new project.symbol-reference-completeness criterion could be exercised against a real 'rebar review-plan' run. Seven runs were made against it; the results are recorded in docs/serena-symbol-reference-coaching-sample.md and on 84c7. No rename was ever intended or performed - do NOT implement this plan. Archiving.","timestamp":1785389613136245001}],"created_at":1785378088731086001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"# Rename `_anthropic_cache_settings` to `_anthropic_cache_options`\n\n## Context / Problem\n\n`_anthropic_cache_settings` in `src/rebar/llm/anthropic_model.py` returns a pydantic-ai\n`ModelSettings` mapping (or `None` for a non-Anthropic model), not a settings object. Readers\nhave twice mistaken it for a config accessor. Renaming it to `_anthropic_cache_options` makes the\nreturn shape read correctly at every call site. Pure rename: no behaviour change, no signature\nchange, no new capability.\n\n## Approach\n\nRename the definition, then update every reference — including the ones that name the symbol as\na string, which a rename refactor will not touch.\n\n## Scope\n\nI went through the tree with `grep` and these are the files that mention it:\n\n- `src/rebar/llm/anthropic_model.py` — the definition (line 39) and the module docstring (line 10).\n- `src/rebar/llm/runner.py` — the re-export import (line 28) and the call site (line 337).\n- `tests/unit/test_pydantic_ai_runner.py` — the import (line 17) and four direct call sites\n  (lines 313, 317, 318, 319).\n- `tests/interfaces/store/test_execution_mode_dispatch.py` — line 90, where the symbol is named\n  as a **string literal** inside `monkeypatch.setattr(runner_mod, \"_anthropic_cache_settings\", …)`.\n  A rename refactor will not touch this; after the rename the patch would silently target a name\n  that no longer exists.\n- `docs/code-navigation.md` — four occurrences, where this symbol is the worked example.\n- `docs/serena-symbol-reference-coaching-sample.md` — two occurrences, same reason.\n\n## Testing\n\nEvery acceptance criterion is checked by a command that runs in-session and produces observable\noutput:\n\n- `git grep -n _anthropic_cache_settings` must print nothing and exit 1.\n- `git grep -n _anthropic_cache_options` must print the definition, the re-export, the call site,\n  the test call sites, the monkeypatch string, and the doc occurrences.\n- `make test` must pass, exercising the renamed function through `tests/unit/test_pydantic_ai_runner.py`\n  and the monkeypatch through `tests/interfaces/store/test_execution_mode_dispatch.py`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `git grep -n _anthropic_cache_settings` prints nothing and exits 1 (the old name is gone\n      from the whole tree, including docs and the string literal)\n- [ ] `_anthropic_cache_options` is defined in `src/rebar/llm/anthropic_model.py`, re-exported from\n      `src/rebar/llm/runner.py`, called at the cache-settings site, and used at all four\n      `tests/unit/test_pydantic_ai_runner.py` call sites, verified by `git grep -n _anthropic_cache_options`\n- [ ] `tests/interfaces/store/test_execution_mode_dispatch.py:90` patches the NEW name, verified by\n      `git grep -n '\"_anthropic_cache_options\"' tests/`\n- [ ] behaviour is unchanged: the function still returns the cache-control settings mapping for an\n      `anthropic:` model and `None` for `openai:`/`google-gla:`/`\"\"`\n- [ ] `make lint`, `make typecheck` and `make test` all pass","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/anthropic_model.py","reason":"definition + docstring"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/runner.py","reason":"re-export + call site"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_pydantic_ai_runner.py","reason":"import + 4 call sites"},{"path":"tests/interfaces/store/test_execution_mode_dispatch.py","reason":"monkeypatch.setattr string literal at line 90"},{"path":"docs/code-navigation.md","reason":"4 worked-example occurrences"},{"path":"docs/serena-symbol-reference-coaching-sample.md","reason":"2 occurrences"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"archived","tags":[],"ticket_id":"4b14-8eae-404c-4b16","ticket_type":"task","title":"DEMO — rename _anthropic_cache_settings (deliberately thin inventory)","verify_commands":[{"command":"git grep -n _anthropic_cache_settings; test $? -eq 1","dd_id":"DD1","dd_text":"old name gone"},{"command":"git grep -n _anthropic_cache_options","dd_id":"DD2","dd_text":"new name present at all three sites"},{"command":"make test","dd_id":"DD3","dd_text":"suite green"}]},"source_event_uuids":["9ac52c6b-2d95-4178-acc1-bac2b5c30d55","a1675489-e817-4be6-a14e-134f7a7fb4b5","6cd74b41-1126-42cf-a845-b8a58856cc00","0fa53c5c-5cce-40f9-84be-cf77c6a08f6e","448613f7-39a1-4523-a8b3-06f440d71e14","58296ea4-5ac7-4d5a-b2d0-d6f62c83bc0b","bb150d49-c7f2-4c1a-ab2b-d08ff3abdaf9","c65322bd-d049-4a5d-977a-c2e44dcb2693"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786659583306984001,"uuid":"4d0d1be3-915a-4066-a2c5-e87535851803"}